The '''Fissure''' is a monster exclusive to {{s|Downpour}}, resembling a fish wearing a skull on its head. Fissures do not need to be defeated to clear the room, and rather act as a stage hazard, spawning endlessly by jumping out of pits and bouncing off walls until they land in a pit again. They can be damaged normally, despite their vague resemblance to {{E|Host}}s. If a fissure goes too long without re-entering a pit, it dies.

== Trivia ==
* Fissure is based off of [[theendisnigh:Enemies|the monster of the same name]] from The End is Nigh.
* Fissure shares its name with a cut enemy in Repentance, [[anti:Spider#Fissure|Fissure]], which appeared in Antibirth.

